#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:1
#: 81227dcdc4bb49319697070410384803
msgid "The Luenberger Indicator: Change in Units of a Declared Programme"
msgstr "Luenberger 生产率指标：用既定改进方案的单位衡量变化"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:3
#: eb5a388406f24b0280d4457fb5dd3d72
msgid ""
"A hospital board may define next year's improvement programme without ever "
"using a percentage. It might ask each hospital to hold its staffed capacity "
"constant while treating 500 additional patients. A manufacturer might commit"
" to saving ten tonnes of material while delivering 200 additional units of "
"product. A public transport agency might seek a joint reduction in vehicle-"
"hours and increase in passenger journeys. In each case, management has "
"described improvement as a **bundle of operational changes**."
msgstr ""
"医院董事会可以完全不借助百分比来规定下一年度的改进方案。例如，要求各医院在人员配置能力不变的情况下多诊疗 500 名患者；制造企业可能承诺在增加 200"
" 件产品交付量的同时节约 10 "
"吨材料；公共交通机构则可能希望同时减少车辆运营小时并增加客运人次。每一种情形中，管理者都是用一组**经营活动变化组合**来界定改进。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:11
#: 1337a708d65147bbbccfc4ad7e87642e
msgid ""
"The ordinary Luenberger productivity indicator asks whether the organization"
" realized more or less of that improvement programme between two periods. It"
" reports change in the programme's own units. If one unit means “save ten "
"tonnes of material and deliver 200 extra units,” a value of 0.4 corresponds "
"to four tonnes of saving and 80 additional units along that joint plan. The "
"direction therefore embeds management's chosen resource--output trade-off "
"and determines what counts as progress. Selecting it after seeing the "
"ranking would replace the original decision problem with a convenient "
"retrospective one."
msgstr ""
"普通 Luenberger 生产率指标考察组织在两个时期之间实现了这套改进方案的更多还是更少，并以方案自身的单位报告变化。如果一个方案单位表示“节约 "
"10 吨材料并额外交付 200 件产品”，那么 0.4 就对应沿该联合方案节约 4 吨材料并增加 80 "
"件产品。方向由此体现管理者选择的资源—产出权衡，并规定何为进步。若看到排序后才选择方向，就把原来的决策问题换成了一个事后更方便的问题。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:20
#: 463e787d405b48498de9cf06bc5107a3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This makes Luenberger measurement useful when proportional expansion or "
"contraction is not the question of interest. The familiar Malmquist index "
"asks about proportional productivity change and reports a ratio around one. "
"The Luenberger indicator measures change additively around zero. Its "
"foundations lie in directional benefit and distance functions and in exact "
"nonradial productivity measurement {cite:p}`chambers1996,chambers2002`."
msgstr ""
"因此，当研究关心的不是等比例扩张或收缩时，Luenberger 测度尤其有用。熟悉的 Malmquist 指数考察生产率的比例变化，并报告以 1 "
"为中性值的比率；Luenberger 指标则以 0 为中性值作加法度量。其理论基础来自方向性收益函数、方向性距离函数和精确的非径向生产率测度 "
"{cite:p}`chambers1996,chambers2002`。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:26
#: 6b34db4d9ce0402590afecc74ba1782f
msgid ""
"An important boundary should be clear from the outset. The ordinary "
"Luenberger indicator in this chapter is a **directional technical-"
"performance indicator**. It does not, merely because it is called a "
"productivity indicator, construct a complete total-factor-productivity "
"account in which an aggregate output quantity index is compared with an "
"aggregate input quantity index. Its value is nevertheless economically "
"meaningful: it reports change relative to production opportunities in the "
"units of a programme that the analyst has made explicit."
msgstr ""
"首先必须划清一条重要边界。本章的普通 Luenberger "
"指标是一个**方向性技术绩效指标**。它不会仅仅因为名称中含有“生产率指标”，就自动构造一个用综合产出数量指数与综合投入数量指数相比的完整全要素生产率账户。但它仍具有明确的经济含义：以分析者明确声明的方案单位，报告相对于生产机会的变化。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:34
#: 24d8b02a174240cfaa851ec867844811
msgid "From an operating commitment to a directional distance"
msgstr "从经营承诺到方向性距离"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:36
#: 1d5dcb89214342eb9ecebd63548facf6
msgid ""
"Let $\\mathcal T^\\tau$ denote the production possibilities represented by "
"the organizations in reference period $\\tau$. An operating plan $z=(x,y)$ "
"uses the resource vector $x$ to deliver the desirable-output vector $y$. The"
" analyst declares a common programme"
msgstr ""
"以 $\\mathcal T^\\tau$ 表示参照期 $\\tau$ 的组织所代表的生产可能性。经营方案 $z=(x,y)$ 使用资源向量 $x$ "
"提供合意产出向量 $y$。分析者声明一套共同改进方案"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:41
#: fe20763845e442fe892b8a9370ab8ac4
msgid ""
"\n"
"g=(g^x,g^y),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"g=(g^x,g^y),\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:45
#: c287e81a75b5494d91b92baea55fb1ab
msgid ""
"where $g^x$ contains planned input savings and $g^y$ contains planned output"
" gains. Both are written as nonnegative magnitudes. Completing $\\beta$ "
"units of the programme would move the operating plan to"
msgstr "其中，$g^x$ 表示计划节约的投入，$g^y$ 表示计划增加的产出，二者均写为非负幅度。完成 $\\beta$ 个方案单位，会把经营方案调整为"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:49
#: 1f5c3f5142634bcca2ad0df3ae1f50d3
msgid ""
"\n"
"(x-\\beta g^x,\\;y+\\beta g^y).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"(x-\\beta g^x,\\;y+\\beta g^y).\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:53
#: 17cfa718c6fc400dac985d98130f4907
msgid "The directional distance relative to period-$\\tau$ opportunities is"
msgstr "相对于时期 $\\tau$ 生产机会的方向性距离为"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:55
#: edefbcb06fe04edfb24975dc0a4d0629
msgid ""
"\n"
"D^\\tau(z;g)\n"
"=\\sup\\left\\{\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}:\n"
"(x-\\beta g^x,\\;y+\\beta g^y)\\in\\mathcal T^\\tau\\right\\}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"D^\\tau(z;g)\n"
"=\\sup\\left\\{\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}:\n"
"(x-\\beta g^x,\\;y+\\beta g^y)\\in\\mathcal T^\\tau\\right\\}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:61
#: f4932401018e44a4b1f3e1a338e6529f
msgid ""
"This expression asks how much of the specified resource saving and output "
"gain remains attainable from plan $z$. If $D^\\tau(z;g)=0.6$, comparable "
"practice supports another 0.6 units of the joint programme. A value of zero "
"means that the whole package cannot be advanced further under that period's "
"observed opportunities, although other unmeasured or differently composed "
"improvements may still be possible. A smaller remaining amount indicates "
"that the organization is closer to exhausting this particular improvement "
"opportunity."
msgstr ""
"该式考察从方案 $z$ 出发，既定的资源节约与产出增加还能够实现多少。若 $D^\\tau(z;g)=0.6$，可比实践支持再完成 0.6 "
"个联合方案单位。取值为 0 "
"表示在该期观测到的生产机会下，这套完整方案已经不能继续推进；但仍可能存在未被测量或构成不同的其他改进。剩余量越小，说明组织越接近用尽这项特定改进机会。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:69
#: 98868808d85247488f04a707d42ce27d
msgid ""
"The programme need not change every variable. A health authority interested "
"in additional treatments at unchanged staffed capacity can set $g^x=0$ and "
"give $g^y$ the physical size of one treatment commitment. A resource-"
"conservation programme can hold outputs fixed by setting $g^y=0$. A joint "
"programme assigns positive magnitudes to both sides. Zeros mean that the "
"corresponding quantities are commitments to be held fixed during this "
"particular appraisal; they do not imply that those quantities are "
"unimportant to production."
msgstr ""
"改进方案不必改变每一个变量。若卫生主管部门关心在人员配置能力不变时增加诊疗量，可以令 $g^x=0$，并把 $g^y$ "
"设为一项诊疗承诺的实际规模。资源节约方案可令 $g^y=0$，使产出保持不变。联合方案则在投入和产出两侧都给出正幅度。某一分量为 "
"0，表示在这次评价中相应数量被作为必须保持不变的承诺，而不表示它对生产无关紧要。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:77
#: 04b44fe44b164461b97c7b07baa8d8f9
msgid ""
"Because the indicator is cardinal, the size of the programme matters. "
"Replacing $g$ with $cg$, for $c>0$, changes the numerical distance according"
" to"
msgstr "由于该指标具有基数意义，方案单位的大小会影响数值。用 $cg$（$c>0$）替换 $g$ 时，方向性距离按下式变化："

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:80
#: 148c3747b3044dbdae161d3cbb6d0000
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"D^\\tau(z;cg)=\\frac{1}{c}D^\\tau(z;g).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"D^\\tau(z;cg)=\\frac{1}{c}D^\\tau(z;g).\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:84
#: e206bf2dcf084f42aa23b4bdbd30f909
msgid ""
"Doubling the physical size of one programme unit therefore halves the number"
" of programme units reported. That is not a defect. It is the same reason "
"that 500 metres and 0.5 kilometres use different numbers to describe the "
"same distance. Trouble arises only when results measured under different "
"programmes are compared as though they shared one unit."
msgstr ""
"把一个方案单位的实际规模扩大一倍，报告的方案单位数就会减半。这不是缺陷，就像 500 米与 0.5 "
"千米用不同数值描述同一段长度。只有把不同方案单位下测得的结果误当成同一单位进行比较时，才会产生问题。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:90
#: b777238c5a3340e28457f47ef25d0da6
msgid "Four appraisals behind one change indicator"
msgstr "一个变化指标背后的四次评价"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:92
#: 33f23e0d9e3347a282063e49e7bbaccf
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Consider one organization observed in adjacent periods $t$ and $t+1$, with "
"plans $z^t=(x^t,y^t)$ and $z^{t+1}=(x^{t+1},y^{t+1})$. Productivity "
"measurement has to separate two changes that occur at the same time. The "
"organization may realize more of the opportunities available to it, and the "
"best-practice opportunities represented by the comparison population may "
"themselves become more or less favorable."
msgstr ""
"设同一组织在相邻时期 $t$ 和 $t+1$ 的经营方案分别为 $z^t=(x^t,y^t)$ 与 "
"$z^{t+1}=(x^{t+1},y^{t+1})$。生产率测度必须区分同时发生的两类变化：组织可能更多地实现其可用生产机会，而比较总体所代表的最佳实践机会本身也可能变得更有利或更不利。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:98
#: 489d0e049d824b21a69fe5085633a51b
msgid ""
"To distinguish these changes, each plan is appraised against each period's "
"production opportunities:"
msgstr "为区分这两类变化，需要把两个时期的方案分别放到两个时期的生产机会下评价："

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 1be5c74521eb4501812b592ab4c5b859 8c5b3494900e4943b5ffc6ab0ccf41d7
msgid "Appraisal"
msgstr "评价"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 99fcca760d2e49e7b579101beb6e66a3
msgid "Economic question"
msgstr "经济问题"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 38f1c84b5fb345d79c9456d5a7c6e7d1
msgid "$D^t(z^t;g)$"
msgstr "$D^t(z^t;g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 90c319cf2b7c476f8c063dddaf938a15
msgid ""
"How much of the programme remained unrealized by the old plan under old "
"opportunities?"
msgstr "在旧生产机会下，旧方案还有多少改进方案尚未实现？"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 926cfa69464749e9a6588eed8f3e69fd
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$D^t(z^{t+1};g)$"
msgstr "$D^t(z^{t+1};g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 927d604b0b7b44afba0b01f46e74f7df
msgid "How would the new plan have performed under old opportunities?"
msgstr "在旧生产机会下，新方案会有怎样的表现？"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 751055b41b8046a49b0656429f5e2fdf
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$D^{t+1}(z^t;g)$"
msgstr "$D^{t+1}(z^t;g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: f3679ee1fe97441db398d3a3652aeaab
msgid "How would the old plan perform under new opportunities?"
msgstr "在新生产机会下，旧方案会有怎样的表现？"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 4b6409d8d361463dabc2c5dbd8ed8f86
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g)$"
msgstr "$D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md
#: 6a51e6bd59394a3d88f2c92193bd66aa
msgid "How much remained unrealized by the new plan under new opportunities?"
msgstr "在新生产机会下，新方案还有多少改进方案尚未实现？"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:108
#: e84dd6c83435485f86e0bb5ddd544720
msgid ""
"One common input-saving and output-expansion programme is used to appraise "
"two period-specific operating plans against both period-specific production "
"technologies, producing four directional distances and one additive change "
"account"
msgstr "用一套共同的投入节约与产出扩张方案，把两个时期的经营方案分别放到两个时期的生产技术下评价，从而得到四个方向性距离和一个加法变化账户"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:113
#: eface2418ab54297b9e1fbbaca5a7a41
msgid ""
"One declared programme supplies the common unit for all four appraisals. The"
" two diagonal cells describe contemporaneous operating shortfalls; the off-"
"diagonal cells show how each plan would be assessed under the other period's"
" represented opportunities."
msgstr "同一套既定方案为四次评价提供共同计量单位。对角线上的两个单元格描述同期经营缺口；非对角线单元格则说明每个方案放到另一时期所代表的生产机会下会得到怎样的评价。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:119
#: 15dc7331cdae41569fc576bf31605b05
msgid "Holding the old technology fixed gives one view of performance change:"
msgstr "固定旧生产技术，可以得到一种绩效变化度量："

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:121
#: 019c22e4745f4f8a871112eef49f5d23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"P^t\n"
"=D^t(z^t;g)-D^t(z^{t+1};g).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P^t\n"
"=D^t(z^t;g)-D^t(z^{t+1};g).\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:126
#: c68546e334af469f942c17a1bc6f8bc7
msgid "Holding the new technology fixed gives the other:"
msgstr "固定新生产技术，则得到另一种度量："

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:128
#: 6ce7a3c05fa045aaa97aafc648d22af5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"P^{t+1}\n"
"=D^{t+1}(z^t;g)-D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P^{t+1}\n"
"=D^{t+1}(z^t;g)-D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g).\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:133
#: f0c740e3ee9f4713bd7022d43ffabd4c
msgid ""
"In each expression, the old plan's unrealized potential is compared with the"
" new plan's unrealized potential while the benchmark is held constant. A "
"positive difference means that the new plan realizes more of the declared "
"programme. Neither period is given sole authority, so the adjacent-period "
"Luenberger indicator takes the arithmetic mean:"
msgstr ""
"在每个表达式中，都在参照标准保持不变时比较旧方案与新方案尚未实现的潜力。差值为正，表示新方案实现了更多既定改进。两个时期都不被赋予唯一权威，因此相邻期 "
"Luenberger 指标取二者的算术平均："

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:139
#: e2c5c780b8ba4166b6f5208a128f6eb6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"L^{t,t+1}\n"
"&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(P^t+P^{t+1}\\right)\\\\\n"
"&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\n"
"D^t(z^t;g)-D^t(z^{t+1};g)\n"
"+D^{t+1}(z^t;g)-D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g)\n"
"\\right].\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"L^{t,t+1}\n"
"&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(P^t+P^{t+1}\\right)\\\\\n"
"&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\n"
"D^t(z^t;g)-D^t(z^{t+1};g)\n"
"+D^{t+1}(z^t;g)-D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g)\n"
"\\right].\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:150
#: 2ce7943219fd4ea399bfd87a88241fad
msgid ""
"The reporting convention in this book is straightforward: $L>0$ indicates "
"measured improvement, $L=0$ no measured change, and $L<0$ measured decline. "
"These are programme units, not percentage points. An indicator of 0.25 and a"
" Malmquist index of 1.25 do not say the same thing, even though both numbers"
" may casually be described as a 25 percent improvement. Only the latter is a"
" ratio with that percentage interpretation."
msgstr ""
"本书的报告约定很直接：$L>0$ 表示测得改善，$L=0$ 表示未测得变化，$L<0$ "
"表示测得下降。这些数值的单位是方案单位，不是百分点。Luenberger 指标 0.25 与 Malmquist 指数 1.25 "
"并不表达同一件事，即使二者有时都被随意描述为“改善 25%”。只有后者是具有这一百分比解释的比率。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:156
#: 5e1ecda0a9df49a198b04454505b7ddf
msgid "An additive account of two benchmark-relative changes"
msgstr "两个相对标杆变化的加法账户"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:158
#: d65ad5366bdc4bfb9476264695e8232b
msgid ""
"The four appraisals also support an exact additive decomposition. Define "
"relative operating-performance change as"
msgstr "四次评价还支持一个精确的加法分解。将相对经营绩效变化定义为"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:161
#: 699f97741365433cb244250fbf870e97
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"EC_L^{t,t+1}\n"
"=D^t(z^t;g)-D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"EC_L^{t,t+1}\n"
"=D^t(z^t;g)-D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g).\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:166
#: c19a6dcd5b7149e087cb3c716c1841b4
msgid ""
"This component compares the programme left unrealized by the organization "
"against the best-practice opportunities represented in each plan's own "
"period. A positive value means that the contemporaneous shortfall became "
"smaller. “Catch-up” is often used as historical shorthand, but the more "
"informative statement is that the organization realized more of the declared"
" programme relative to its contemporaneous comparison population."
msgstr "该分量比较组织在各自时期的最佳实践机会下尚未实现的方案数量。取正值表示同期经营缺口缩小。“追赶”是常见的历史简称，但更准确的表述是：相对于同期比较总体，组织实现了更多既定改进方案。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:173
#: 13edeceb0a9842ddbeec697dc0e61904
msgid ""
"The component is not proof of better management. A smaller shortfall may "
"accompany improved scheduling, maintenance, learning, or coordination, but "
"it may also reflect a different case mix, reporting revision, or comparison "
"population. DEA supplies the benchmark-relative account; institutional "
"evidence is needed to explain its cause."
msgstr ""
"该分量不能证明管理改善。较小的经营缺口可能伴随排班、维护、学习或协调的改善，也可能反映病例组合变化、报告修订或比较总体改变。DEA "
"提供相对标杆账户；解释其成因还需要制度与情境证据。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:178
#: b3f1cf434bd94624957bcf652462ba17
msgid "The change in represented production opportunities is"
msgstr "所代表生产机会的变化为"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:180
#: f7a075f5564e4f57bd2373fdc02568d8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"TC_L^{t,t+1}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\n"
"D^{t+1}(z^t;g)-D^t(z^t;g)\n"
"+D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g)-D^t(z^{t+1};g)\n"
"\\right].\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"TC_L^{t,t+1}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\n"
"D^{t+1}(z^t;g)-D^t(z^t;g)\n"
"+D^{t+1}(z^{t+1};g)-D^t(z^{t+1};g)\n"
"\\right].\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:188
#: 998b977c676446ddbb127802650ed376
msgid ""
"This component asks whether the new reference technology supports more of "
"the programme than the old reference technology, first at the old operating "
"plan and then at the new one. A positive value means that the best-practice "
"opportunities represented by the declared samples became more favorable for "
"the plans and programme being studied. “Frontier shift” is the familiar "
"shorthand, but it should not be mistaken for evidence that a new invention "
"appeared or diffused. The reference set can change because of investment, "
"regulation, demand, data coverage, entry and exit, or genuine technical "
"progress."
msgstr "该分量考察新参照技术是否比旧参照技术支持更多既定方案，并分别在旧经营方案和新经营方案处评价。取正值表示：就所研究的方案和经营规模而言，声明样本所代表的最佳实践机会变得更有利。“前沿移动”是熟悉的简称，但不能据此断言出现或扩散了新发明。参照集可能因为投资、监管、需求、数据覆盖、进入退出或真实技术进步而变化。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:197
#: 6b69d3e34b4d43e4bb9cc0f741bdef39
msgid "The two components reconstruct the overall indicator exactly:"
msgstr "两个分量精确重构总体指标："

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:199
#: 1345928f2a3549959e774115a95d2f2f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"L^{t,t+1}=EC_L^{t,t+1}+TC_L^{t,t+1}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"L^{t,t+1}=EC_L^{t,t+1}+TC_L^{t,t+1}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:203
#: fbea74bdf29c453f91b17a62a65ef20c
msgid ""
"This identity is the heart of the account. It also imposes discipline on "
"interpretation. The components are allocations of one measured change under "
"one programme and one pair of reference technologies. They are not "
"independent causal effects, and components calculated with different "
"directions cannot legitimately be added together."
msgstr "这条恒等式是整个账户的核心，也约束了解释方式。两个分量是在同一改进方案和同一对参照技术下，对同一个测得变化进行的分配，并非彼此独立的因果效应；使用不同方向计算的分量也不能合法相加。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:209
#: 8c05445b9b1e4b889da89df4bc4611d9
msgid "Why a cross-period distance may be negative"
msgstr "为什么跨期距离可能为负"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:211
#: b72de9f304c84aa59752cc650236a6b2
msgid ""
"A contemporaneous plan included in its own reference technology normally has"
" nonnegative unrealized improvement potential. A cross-period plan is "
"different. The new plan may deliver more than the old technology can "
"reproduce. If the only way to place that plan inside the old production "
"possibilities is to reverse the declared programme, its directional distance"
" is negative."
msgstr "纳入自身时期参照技术的同期方案，其尚未实现的改进潜力通常非负。跨期方案则不同：新方案可能提供了旧技术无法再现的产出。如果只有反向执行既定改进方案才能把新方案放回旧生产可能集，那么它的方向性距离就是负值。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:217
#: 2fcd63e38468414485182dff2e221c95
msgid ""
"Suppose one programme unit means adding five treatment batches with "
"resources held fixed. A new plan delivers ten batches more than the old "
"reference technology can support. Relative to the old opportunities, the "
"plan must surrender two programme units before it becomes reproducible, so "
"its cross-period distance is $-2$. This is not “negative efficiency.” It is "
"a signed statement about the position of one period's plan relative to "
"another period's represented opportunities."
msgstr ""
"假设一个方案单位表示在资源不变时增加 5 批诊疗。新方案比旧参照技术可支持的水平多提供 10 "
"批。相对于旧生产机会，必须先放弃两个方案单位才可再现该方案，因此其跨期距离为 "
"$-2$。这不是“负效率”，而是一个时期的方案相对于另一时期所代表生产机会的位置所形成的带符号陈述。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:224
#: ed33106d307f45ef903cc00865761ca9
msgid ""
"Allowing the sign is essential. Replacing a negative cross-period value by "
"zero would erase evidence that the later plan exceeded the earlier "
"opportunities. It would also distort the measured change in represented "
"opportunities and generally break the additive identity. A valid negative "
"value should therefore be explained, not repaired. It is conceptually "
"distinct from a comparison that cannot be formed under the declared "
"technology and data assumptions."
msgstr ""
"允许负号至关重要。把负的跨期值截为 "
"0，会抹去后期方案超越早期生产机会的证据，也会扭曲所代表生产机会的变化，并通常破坏加法恒等式。因此，有效的负值应当得到解释，而不是被“修复”。它在概念上不同于在既定技术和数据假设下根本无法形成的比较。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:231
#: da0b7fb36f6c41c6a2dfc47fa4d241b6
msgid "A hospital programme with an explicit common direction"
msgstr "具有明确共同方向的医院方案"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:233
#: de526c2c7200432f978f53f25a89ee57
msgid ""
"Consider two hospitals observed in 2020 and 2021. Inputs are measured in "
"standardized staff bundles and outputs in batches of 100 completed "
"treatments. In 2020, the observed best-practice rate is one treatment batch "
"per staff bundle. In 2021, both hospitals demonstrate two treatment batches "
"per staff bundle."
msgstr ""
"考虑 2020 年和 2021 年观测到的两家医院。投入以标准化人员组合计量，产出以每 100 例完成诊疗为一批计量。2020 "
"年观测到的最佳实践比率为每个人员组合提供 1 批诊疗；2021 年两家医院都实现了每个人员组合提供 2 批诊疗。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:238
#: 3e216c24f7cc41acba1e802c3b319d92
msgid ""
"The authority's programme is deliberately simple: **hold staff input "
"constant and add one treatment batch**. Thus every hospital and every period"
" is evaluated with the same direction, $g^x=0$ and $g^y=1$."
msgstr "主管部门有意采用一项简单方案：**保持人员投入不变，增加一批诊疗**。因此，对每家医院和每个时期都使用同一方向，即 $g^x=0$、$g^y=1$。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: e0c93ed26e6049e3b0f49c4aa9549ca7
msgid ""
"A point plot reports one additional treatment-batch programme unit for "
"Hospital A and two for Hospital B between 2020 and 2021, with zero as the "
"no-change benchmark"
msgstr "点图显示，2020—2021 年间，医院 A 增加 1 个诊疗批次方案单位，医院 B 增加 2 个，0 表示没有变化"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:292
#: a874aebd3eda42eaaaa0665456d6c2b2
msgid ""
"The plot compares the two hospitals in **absolute programme units**. "
"Hospital A records 1 and Hospital B records 2 because one unit always means "
"one additional treatment batch at unchanged staff input. B's value of 2 does"
" **not** mean that B is twice as productive as A; neither value is a ratio "
"or percentage."
msgstr ""
"图中用**绝对方案单位**比较两家医院。医院 A 为 1、医院 B 为 2，因为一个单位始终表示在人员投入不变时增加一批诊疗。B 取值 2 "
"并不表示其生产率是 A 的两倍；两个数值都不是比率或百分比。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:299
#: 61cf0abd5fb144f5a58983cf79a43cc9
msgid "For Hospital A, the four appraisals have transparent values:"
msgstr "医院 A 的四次评价具有直观数值："

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: eaebbe0985e54dd2bad536b0bd32be22
msgid "Value"
msgstr "数值"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: ac4042d547dc45afbf8841a986ba0a0b
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: d5100285cd1741719594a509f5e0a060
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$D^{2020}(z^{2020};g)$"
msgstr "$D^{2020}(z^{2020};g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 0b5b237dbf1a4db49537d89a11ae9b55 3e841839f7e0433f94055097c62b00f3
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 02a3f3e009a642caaffbf747cfe2b8cc
msgid "The 2020 plan is on the 2020 benchmark."
msgstr "2020 年方案位于 2020 年标杆上。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 842f17d8cc81447e97b6d3492e599e20
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$D^{2020}(z^{2021};g)$"
msgstr "$D^{2020}(z^{2021};g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: a13615d300b5412eb6382300ace888f4
msgid "$-1$"
msgstr "$-1$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 62cd8a3ff64d40c787986738627b68ac
msgid "The 2021 plan exceeds 2020 opportunities by one programme unit."
msgstr "2021 年方案比 2020 年生产机会多 1 个方案单位。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 1cd760aa6c31475ab00576a3583c6bda
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$D^{2021}(z^{2020};g)$"
msgstr "$D^{2021}(z^{2020};g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: b507cbf7553f4b6fa68a5fc1206ed372
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 44fcccc5be8b4ef3b347e415e0977557
msgid "Under 2021 opportunities, the old plan could add one treatment batch."
msgstr "在 2021 年生产机会下，旧方案还可以增加一批诊疗。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 8828ae5aa26c4f6cbc2956bdf9cf8005
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$D^{2021}(z^{2021};g)$"
msgstr "$D^{2021}(z^{2021};g)$"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 5e2d47632dea43dca6a1db3c6f128c3e
msgid "The 2021 plan is on the 2021 benchmark."
msgstr "2021 年方案位于 2021 年标杆上。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:308
#: 9c00a54b9510491d8bfd751f0a563a03
msgid "The overall change is therefore"
msgstr "因此，总体变化为"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:310
#: 1ab59a0879b9407b9693fd5f1dde4407
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"L^{2020,2021}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{2}\\{[0-(-1)]+[1-0]\\}=1.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"L^{2020,2021}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{2}\\{[0-(-1)]+[1-0]\\}=1.\n"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:315
#: 655e1837dfe6415dae0944ae5d72aa5f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hospital A remains on its contemporaneous benchmark in both years, so "
"$EC_L^{2020,2021}=0$. The represented production opportunities become more "
"favorable by one programme unit at the hospital's scale, so "
"$TC_L^{2020,2021}=1$. The account is $1=0+1$: with the same staff bundle, "
"the hospital delivers one additional batch of 100 treatments, and the "
"measured change is associated with changed sector opportunities rather than "
"a smaller contemporaneous operating shortfall."
msgstr ""
"医院 A 两年都位于同期标杆上，因此 $EC_L^{2020,2021}=0$。在该医院的经营规模上，所代表的生产机会改善了 1 个方案单位，因此 "
"$TC_L^{2020,2021}=1$。账户为 $1=0+1$：使用同样的人员组合，医院多提供了 1 批、即 100 "
"例诊疗；测得变化被归入行业生产机会变化，而不是同期经营缺口缩小。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:322
#: 2081329db553458e8661260c8974b618
msgid ""
"Hospital B receives $L=2$ because the same physical programme unit is "
"applied to an operation twice as large. This does not mean that B is “twice "
"as productive” as A. It means that B realizes two additional batches under "
"an absolute programme measured in treatment batches. If the policy question "
"concerns proportional rather than absolute change, the analyst needs a "
"proportional measure or a different, explicitly justified common "
"normalization. Changing the programme after seeing the result would change "
"the question, not merely its presentation."
msgstr ""
"医院 B 的 $L=2$，因为同一个实际方案单位被用于规模大一倍的经营活动。这不表示 B 的“生产率是 A "
"的两倍”，而表示在以诊疗批次计量的绝对方案下，B "
"多实现了两批诊疗。若政策问题关心比例变化而非绝对变化，分析者需要使用比例测度，或者采用另一项有明确依据的共同标准化方案。看到结果后再改变方案，就是改变研究问题，而不只是改变展示方式。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:330
#: 88dc53a9ea1344d88ae05a253bef5a6b
msgid ""
"This interpretation requires all four appraisals to be available under the "
"same programme and to close the account $L=EC_L+TC_L$. If either condition "
"fails, there is no productivity conclusion for that transition. The detailed"
" implementation evidence belongs in the DEAPack Documentation."
msgstr ""
"这一解释要求四次评价都能在同一方案下获得，并满足 $L=EC_L+TC_L$。任一条件不成立，就不能对该次转变作出生产率结论。实现细节和验证证据见 "
"DEAPack Documentation。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:335
#: 910cd61cd776476b9330107a9e769289
msgid "Choosing a direction that can support a decision"
msgstr "选择能够支持决策的方向"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:337
#: 22b2fb053cc24387af042fb8d4fb102c
msgid ""
"A defensible direction begins with the purpose of the study. A regulator may"
" derive it from a stated service obligation. A firm's operating plan may "
"supply target reductions in labor-hours, energy, and materials together with"
" desired gains in output. A clinical study may hold resources fixed because "
"its question concerns attainable service. The direction should use stable "
"variable definitions and physical units and should be declared before the "
"resulting rankings are interpreted."
msgstr "有根据的方向应当从研究目的出发。监管者可以依据明确的服务义务设定方向；企业经营计划可以同时给出工时、能源和材料的削减目标以及期望增加的产出；临床研究若关心可实现服务量，则可以保持资源不变。方向应使用稳定的变量定义和实际单位，并在解释结果排序之前声明。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:344
#: 9ad46c1887e04ecca5b56463bafbcf7f
msgid ""
"Comparability is especially important over time. The same $g$ must give “one"
" programme unit” the same meaning in all four appraisals. If every "
"organization receives a different direction proportional to its own current "
"operation, its indicator is measured in its own private unit; additive "
"comparisons across organizations and periods then lose their immediate "
"meaning. Such directions may answer legitimate local questions, but they do "
"not automatically form the common cardinal account developed in this "
"chapter."
msgstr ""
"跨期可比性尤其重要。同一个 $g$ "
"必须使“一单位方案”在四次评价中保持同一含义。若每个组织都得到一个与自身当期经营规模成比例的不同方向，其指标就使用各自的私人单位；此时跨组织、跨时期的加法比较不再具有直接含义。这类方向可以回答合理的局部问题，却不会自动形成本章所建立的共同基数账户。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:352
#: 202ce489f62c4b3d87ff724d8e01eea2
msgid ""
"Unit conversion is harmless when the data and the direction are converted "
"together. Expressing both treatments and the treatment component of $g$ in "
"individual cases rather than hundreds of cases leaves the underlying "
"programme unchanged. By contrast, changing only $g$, using a future-expanded"
" sample to redefine a historical direction, or assigning a new programme to "
"each period alters the estimand. A useful sensitivity analysis can compare "
"several substantively defensible common programmes, but each scenario should"
" retain its own label and unit."
msgstr ""
"当数据和方向同时换算时，单位转换不会改变结果。把诊疗量及 $g$ 的诊疗分量同时从“百例”改为“例”，不会改变底层方案。相反，只改变 "
"$g$、用未来扩展后的样本重新定义历史方向，或为每个时期另设一套方案，都会改变估计对象。敏感性分析可以比较若干在实质上有依据的共同方案，但每种情景必须保留自己的名称和单位。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:360
#: 86bbfd19629840dfaad6b23a516fe9fe
msgid ""
"The direction is not a vector of prices and does not reveal willingness to "
"trade one resource or service for another. It states a physical operating "
"commitment. If the research question is about cost, revenue, profit, or "
"welfare, observed prices and the corresponding economic-efficiency model are"
" needed. Directional productivity and price-based economic performance are "
"complementary accounts, not substitutes."
msgstr "方向不是价格向量，也不会揭示组织愿意用一种资源或服务交换另一种资源或服务的程度。它声明的是一项实际经营承诺。若研究问题涉及成本、收益、利润或福利，就需要观测价格及相应经济效率模型。方向性生产率与价格基础的经济绩效是互补账户，不能相互替代。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:366
#: b6589621484e4467b0293dfbdd849d82
msgid "Which change question matches the decision?"
msgstr "哪一种变化问题与决策相匹配？"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:368
#: d6f0993064b74638990039f02d716991
msgid ""
"Several prominent productivity accounts use distance functions. The "
"practical choice begins with the decision question, not with the model name."
msgstr "若干重要生产率账户都使用距离函数。实践中的选择应从决策问题出发，而不是从模型名称出发。"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: a38207504dd54d5ea4721a3d07827397
msgid "Decision account"
msgstr "决策账户"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 16e42d30ceee445f9c3da77938c21c80
msgid "Question the analysis answers"
msgstr "分析回答的问题"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: e4e8a52a35be43d2a8c7b39b00495847
msgid "Reporting form and neutral value"
msgstr "报告形式与中性值"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 0bcb65ecdd7e49129cee34ea8c85099c
msgid "Required production comparison"
msgstr "所需生产比较"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 0f9cb5616dee4628b0b3de710cf0301f
msgid "Proportional productivity change"
msgstr "比例生产率变化"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 931781ae5df94742948539f7e4fb2f21
msgid ""
"How did proportional productivity change relative to period-specific "
"production opportunities?"
msgstr "相对于各期生产机会，比例生产率如何变化？"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: aead26a756d8424c9df092d49903bcbc
msgid "Multiplicative ratio; no change at 1"
msgstr "乘法比率；1 表示没有变化"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 5384bd11bd054baea01ad0c6a6e60cdc
msgid "Radial input or output comparison"
msgstr "径向投入或产出比较"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: 0014da5af2e14964b2b918a7f2194ffb
msgid "Change in a declared operating programme"
msgstr "既定经营方案的变化"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: dd0a3586c32d468484f1770cf9d64d18
msgid "How many more units of the programme were realized?"
msgstr "多实现了多少个方案单位？"

#: ../../chapters/04-productivity/12-luenberger.md:287
#: e570ad36ab034202bb6ccf603c50f807
msgid "Additive indicator; no change at 0"
msgstr "加法指标；0 表示没有变化"

